21
00:02:04,200 --> 00:02:05,750
Xu Mu ?

22
00:02:07,040 --> 00:02:08,590
I'll remember this name.

23
00:02:12,440 --> 00:02:13,470
Named Xu ?

24
00:02:14,200 --> 00:02:15,390
You also thought of it...

25
00:02:17,120 --> 00:02:19,110
For such a powerful Corporeal Yang cultivator to appear,

26
00:02:19,280 --> 00:02:21,590
it has to be the Xu Family of Planet Dong Lin.

27
00:02:22,760 --> 00:02:23,750
Could this person be...

28
00:02:25,600 --> 00:02:27,470
He is very strong.

29
00:02:27,880 --> 00:02:30,190
Even if he isn't a descendant of Planet Dong Lin,

30
00:02:30,560 --> 00:02:32,550
our Tang Family should avoid provoking him.

31
00:02:33,640 --> 00:02:34,950
But Uncle Ping and the others...

32
00:02:35,560 --> 00:02:37,350
They acted recklessly.

33
00:02:38,520 --> 00:02:40,160
Since they're dead, they're dead.

34
00:02:41,320 --> 00:02:42,030
Understood.

35
00:02:47,400 --> 00:02:50,520
Inside the Celestial Cave

36
00:02:47,720 --> 00:02:48,670
Brother Xu,

37
00:02:48,880 --> 00:02:51,710
this cave seems somewhat peculiar.

38
00:02:53,280 --> 00:02:53,990
Look,

39
00:02:54,520 --> 00:02:55,750
on the walls around us,

40
00:02:56,080 --> 00:02:58,240
there are traces of celestial spiritual energy fluctuations.

41
00:02:58,720 --> 00:03:01,030
It must have been isolated from the outside for very long.

42
00:03:03,000 --> 00:03:04,790
Since this place was left by Celestials,

43
00:03:05,800 --> 00:03:07,430
it's strange that no one visited it

44
00:03:07,880 --> 00:03:08,990
before us.

45
00:03:17,200 --> 00:03:19,030
We have been moving at full speed

46
00:03:19,440 --> 00:03:20,910
for half an hour now.

47
00:03:21,480 --> 00:03:22,830
Why haven't we reached the end yet ?

48
00:03:24,200 --> 00:03:25,950
Just how deep is this tunnel ?

49
00:03:27,760 --> 00:03:28,950
Something's wrong.

50
00:03:33,680 --> 00:03:34,150
Brother Xu,

51
00:03:34,280 --> 00:03:34,870
what is it ?

52
00:03:35,720 --> 00:03:37,230
Do you sense anything unusual ?

53
00:03:37,920 --> 00:03:39,190
What do you mean, Brother Xu ?

54
00:03:40,120 --> 00:03:41,310
Since we entered,

55
00:03:41,840 --> 00:03:43,710
I have been using my Divine Sense to probe the path ahead

56
00:03:44,200 --> 00:03:45,150
and mark our way back.

57
00:03:46,520 --> 00:03:47,310
But I discovered

58
00:03:48,520 --> 00:03:49,830
that the tunnel we are in

59
00:03:50,880 --> 00:03:52,190
is a rune.

60
00:03:55,400 --> 00:03:56,070
Brother Li,

61
00:03:56,080 --> 00:03:57,510
do you recognize this rune ?

62
00:03:58,320 --> 00:04:00,990
This rune is a type of celestial restriction.

63
00:04:01,320 --> 00:04:02,110
It's extremely rare

64
00:04:02,480 --> 00:04:03,750
and can't be used by itself.

65
00:04:04,240 --> 00:04:06,590
It needs to be combined with other runes

66
00:04:06,800 --> 00:04:08,550
to form a restriction formation.

67
00:04:10,200 --> 00:04:11,630
So complex...

68
00:04:12,120 --> 00:04:14,390
Can you tell what kind of formation it is ?

69
00:04:19,080 --> 00:04:20,110
Not yet.

70
00:04:20,680 --> 00:04:21,990
We have too little information

71
00:04:22,400 --> 00:04:23,310
to make a guess.

72
00:04:24,080 --> 00:04:25,510
Before we reach the end,

73
00:04:26,120 --> 00:04:27,550
it will be impossible to determine

74
00:04:28,400 --> 00:04:29,510
what formation it is.

75
00:04:30,320 --> 00:04:32,350
The Celestial Realm has been shattered for so long

76
00:04:32,640 --> 00:04:34,750
but this place still has an active formation ?

77
00:04:35,720 --> 00:04:36,990
Whatever is at the end

78
00:04:37,680 --> 00:04:38,700
is either a great treasure

79
00:04:39,360 --> 00:04:40,510
or a great calamity.

80
00:04:41,240 --> 00:04:43,190
But this is too rare of an opportunity...

81
00:04:44,000 --> 00:04:45,390
Giving up now

82
00:04:46,240 --> 00:04:47,230
would be a waste.

83
00:04:49,360 --> 00:04:49,990
Brother Li,

84
00:04:50,880 --> 00:04:51,670
in that case,

85
00:04:52,120 --> 00:04:53,310
let's go down and see.

86
00:04:53,880 --> 00:04:55,310
But remember, we must act cautiously

87
00:04:55,800 --> 00:04:56,870
and understand the formation

88
00:04:57,360 --> 00:04:58,190
before deciding.

89
00:05:01,520 --> 00:05:04,360
30 minutes later

90
00:05:02,080 --> 00:05:03,270
The end is just ahead !

91
00:05:22,240 --> 00:05:22,870
Brother Xu,

92
00:05:23,320 --> 00:05:24,110
I figured it out.

93
00:05:24,760 --> 00:05:25,990
This formation of runes

94
00:05:26,000 --> 00:05:27,030
has only a single function.

95
00:05:27,240 --> 00:05:28,230
It's for healing.

96
00:05:29,240 --> 00:05:30,270
If I'm not mistaken,

97
00:05:30,720 --> 00:05:33,190
there are 9 such runic tunnels in total.

98
00:05:33,960 --> 00:05:35,440
The 9 runes work together

99
00:05:35,440 --> 00:05:37,350
to create a massive healing formation.

100
00:05:38,200 --> 00:05:39,430
All this time,

101
00:05:39,800 --> 00:05:40,950
it never stopped operating.

102
00:05:42,320 --> 00:05:43,510
Brother Li, do you mean that

103
00:05:44,120 --> 00:05:45,070
all this time,

104
00:05:45,520 --> 00:05:47,790
someone has been healing within

105
00:05:48,160 --> 00:05:49,070
this formation ?

106
00:05:49,680 --> 00:05:50,910
In the Thunder Celestial Realm,

107
00:05:51,240 --> 00:05:52,910
someone who could use so many resources

108
00:05:53,320 --> 00:05:54,350
just for healing

109
00:05:55,280 --> 00:05:56,550
must be...

110
00:05:57,160 --> 00:05:58,150
a Celestial !

111
00:05:59,480 --> 00:06:02,400
The Celestial healing in this formation has already awakened.

112
00:06:02,560 --> 00:06:04,910
He most likely sensed our presence long ago

113
00:06:05,280 --> 00:06:07,470
and allowed us to venture this deep.

114
00:06:10,160 --> 00:06:11,550
It's just a mere restriction.

115
00:06:11,920 --> 00:06:13,440
I'm confident I can open it for you, Brother Xu.

116
00:06:18,720 --> 00:06:19,490
Li Yuan !

117
00:06:20,000 --> 00:06:20,710
What's wrong ?

118
00:06:21,060 --> 00:06:21,710
Brother Xu,

119
00:06:22,120 --> 00:06:23,430
don't you want to learn celestial spells ?

120
00:06:23,880 --> 00:06:25,830
If we can find this Celestial,

121
00:06:26,280 --> 00:06:27,350
we will obtain

122
00:06:27,560 --> 00:06:28,670
countless celestial spells !

123
00:06:29,080 --> 00:06:30,510
Brother Xu, let go of me !

124
00:06:30,800 --> 00:06:32,430
I will open the restriction

125
00:06:30,800 --> 00:06:32,840
Li Yuan isn't this reckless usually.

126
00:06:32,440 --> 00:06:33,830
to get the celestial spells !

127
00:06:34,120 --> 00:06:35,110
Let go of me !

128
00:06:35,200 --> 00:06:35,670
Could it be...?

129
00:06:43,720 --> 00:06:45,630
Li Yuan must have been bewitched

130
00:06:45,640 --> 00:06:46,510
by someone.

131
00:06:47,080 --> 00:06:48,950
What exactly is in there ?

132
00:06:52,400 --> 00:06:53,190
You...

133
00:06:53,640 --> 00:06:55,470
What celestial spell do you wish to learn ?

134
00:06:57,320 --> 00:06:58,870
Have your friend

135
00:06:59,400 --> 00:07:01,150
cast those celestial restrictions

136
00:07:01,840 --> 00:07:04,230
and I will grant all your desires.

137
00:07:04,440 --> 00:07:05,310
Who are you ?

138
00:07:07,800 --> 00:07:08,950
Do you want to learn

139
00:07:09,160 --> 00:07:10,750
or not ?

140
00:07:12,160 --> 00:07:14,230
Countless cultivators chase after celestial spells

141
00:07:15,040 --> 00:07:16,550
and this person offers them so easily ?

142
00:07:17,080 --> 00:07:18,440
There must be something wrong.

143
00:07:19,160 --> 00:07:20,910
No matter how precious the celestial spell,

144
00:07:21,200 --> 00:07:22,990
I will only cultivate the ones

145
00:07:23,240 --> 00:07:24,110
I obtain by myself.

146
00:07:25,480 --> 00:07:26,950
I must never repeat the mistake

147
00:07:27,680 --> 00:07:28,990
of the Celestial Slaughter Art.

148
00:07:30,600 --> 00:07:34,150
I hate cautious people !

149
00:07:44,800 --> 00:07:45,630
This is...

150
00:07:47,840 --> 00:07:49,510
I acted impulsively just now.

151
00:07:50,280 --> 00:07:50,950
I held you back...

152
00:07:50,960 --> 00:07:52,110
It's not your fault.

153
00:07:52,600 --> 00:07:54,150
That power was too strange.

154
00:07:54,600 --> 00:07:56,280
We need to quickly leave this place.

155
00:08:00,600 --> 00:08:01,350
What's this !?

156
00:08:02,880 --> 00:08:03,710
Ji Realm !?

157
00:08:06,840 --> 00:08:07,390
Brother Li,

158
00:08:07,520 --> 00:08:08,110
hurry up !

159
00:08:18,640 --> 00:08:19,150
Brother Xu,

160
00:08:19,280 --> 00:08:19,670
quick !

161
00:08:31,720 --> 00:08:34,880
Wasteland
Thunder Celestial Realm

162
00:08:36,280 --> 00:08:37,030
Brother Xu !

163
00:08:47,120 --> 00:08:47,670
Brother Li,

164
00:08:47,840 --> 00:08:48,630
protect me !

165
00:08:52,720 --> 00:08:54,550
I've never seen Brother Xu look so serious.

166
00:08:55,280 --> 00:08:57,080
What exactly was that crimson light ?

167
00:08:57,080 --> 00:09:00,040
Wang Lin's Sea of Consciousness

168
00:09:17,720 --> 00:09:19,630
The power of this Ji Realm is truly astonishing.

169
00:09:20,600 --> 00:09:22,760
If I hadn't once possessed the Ji Realm myself,

170
00:09:22,840 --> 00:09:24,760
