171
00:09:25,240 --> 00:09:26,910
then even with my Corporeal Yang's cultivation,

172
00:09:27,560 --> 00:09:29,710
my Origin Soul would have been destroyed by it !

173
00:09:37,880 --> 00:09:38,870
Celestial spells...

174
00:09:39,400 --> 00:09:40,310
Celestial spells !

175
00:09:52,120 --> 00:09:53,240
Not enough !

176
00:09:53,240 --> 00:09:54,350
It's still not enough !

177
00:09:54,680 --> 00:09:57,070
I need more Qi Refiners !

178
00:09:57,800 --> 00:10:00,030
Only 4 seals remain !

179
00:10:01,040 --> 00:10:02,070
Qing Shui...

180
00:10:02,360 --> 00:10:03,950
The day you will die

181
00:10:04,600 --> 00:10:05,880
