185
00:10:23,080 --> 00:10:24,950
To be able to control such a Ji Realm...

186
00:10:27,080 --> 00:10:28,390
Ji Realm cultivators

187
00:10:28,400 --> 00:10:29,830
can't breakthrough above Nascent Soul.

188
00:10:31,080 --> 00:10:32,510
The only exception

189
00:10:32,600 --> 00:10:34,030
was when I met Na Duo.

190
00:10:34,840 --> 00:10:37,230
But that was because his Ji Realm was gifted by a friend,

191
00:10:37,720 --> 00:10:39,150
not cultivated from scratch.

192
00:10:40,120 --> 00:10:40,790
Could it be...

193
00:10:41,440 --> 00:10:42,670
that there is a way

194
00:10:43,200 --> 00:10:45,280
to continue cultivating with the Ji Realm ?

195
00:10:50,160 --> 00:10:50,760
Brother Xu,

196
00:10:51,000 --> 00:10:51,950
how are your injuries ?

197
00:10:52,440 --> 00:10:53,070
I'm fine.

198
00:10:53,920 --> 00:10:55,390
It would be a pity

199
00:10:55,600 --> 00:10:56,830
