200
00:10:57,360 --> 00:10:58,910
I'd rather sacrifice some origin energy

201
00:10:59,400 --> 00:11:00,470
to keep it.

202
00:11:00,720 --> 00:11:01,870
It may become useful.

203
00:11:03,400 --> 00:11:04,150
Let's go.

204
00:11:04,560 --> 00:11:05,990
We need to find the Collection Pavilion.

205
00:11:12,040 --> 00:11:14,720
