211
00:11:25,160 --> 00:11:26,830
What happened exactly ?

212
00:11:38,480 --> 00:11:39,390
It's Zhan Konglie !

213
00:11:40,040 --> 00:11:40,710
Apparently,

214
00:11:41,240 --> 00:11:43,070
he has become a Thunder Celestial Messenger.

215
00:11:45,000 --> 00:11:46,030
Zhan Konglie !

216
00:11:47,240 --> 00:11:50,670
with Shengong Hu and Tang Yanfeng, they are the 3 Heroes of the Southern Domain.

217
00:11:51,200 --> 00:11:52,790
All 3 are prodigies of their generation.

218
00:11:53,520 --> 00:11:55,950
They all reached Corporeal Yang at a young age.

219
00:11:56,440 --> 00:11:57,870
They have a lot of potential.

220
00:12:07,280 --> 00:12:08,070
Stop there !

221
00:12:37,680 --> 00:12:38,630
Junior Zhan Konglie,

222
00:12:38,920 --> 00:12:39,670
