223
00:12:40,480 --> 00:12:41,350
Senior !?

224
00:12:41,920 --> 00:12:44,150
But this guy's cultivation is the same as Zhan Konglie's...

225
00:12:44,840 --> 00:12:45,830
Corporeal Yang ?

226
00:12:46,280 --> 00:12:47,470
So he really is a Senior.

227
00:12:47,880 --> 00:12:50,110
I couldn't see him hiding his cultivation before,

228
00:12:50,360 --> 00:12:51,790
and it's the same now.

229
00:12:52,960 --> 00:12:54,030
Where are you going

230
00:12:54,560 --> 00:12:55,470
in such haste ?

231
00:12:55,840 --> 00:12:56,590
Senior,

232
00:12:57,240 --> 00:12:58,910
4 fragments of the Thunder Celestial Realm suddenly gave off

233
00:12:59,120 --> 00:13:00,840
powerful celestial spiritual energy fluctuations.

234
00:13:01,440 --> 00:13:02,630
It's all sealed by restrictions

235
00:13:02,640 --> 00:13:04,440
