240
00:13:10,720 --> 00:13:12,110
to accompany me ?

241
00:13:13,040 --> 00:13:14,190
I have other matters.

242
00:13:14,840 --> 00:13:16,070
This journey sounds dangerous,

243
00:13:16,480 --> 00:13:17,430
be careful.

244
00:13:20,720 --> 00:13:21,270
Understood !

245
00:13:21,520 --> 00:13:22,350
Junior will remember !

246
00:13:23,440 --> 00:13:26,600
Central fragment
Thunder Celestial Realm

247
00:13:33,040 --> 00:13:34,990
The Collection Pavilion should be right here.

248
00:13:36,120 --> 00:13:37,710
There are indeed restriction fluctuations here

249
00:13:37,880 --> 00:13:39,310
that are similar to celestial restrictions.

250
00:13:40,320 --> 00:13:41,550
Although they are faint,

251
00:13:42,840 --> 00:13:44,230
I can detect something

252
00:13:44,800 --> 00:13:45,870
