258
00:14:34,760 --> 00:14:35,790
With your restrictions

259
00:14:36,480 --> 00:14:37,510
and my speed,

260
00:14:38,040 --> 00:14:39,190
sending me inside

261
00:14:39,560 --> 00:14:40,470
should be feasible.

262
00:14:41,160 --> 00:14:42,150
Good idea !

263
00:14:42,680 --> 00:14:43,600
It's worth a try.

264
00:14:46,240 --> 00:14:46,870
Brother Li,

265
00:14:47,480 --> 00:14:48,230
once I'm inside,

266
00:14:48,400 --> 00:14:49,430
find a place to hide.

267
00:14:49,960 --> 00:14:51,320
After I obtain the celestial spells,

268
00:14:51,480 --> 00:14:52,470
we will leave together.

269
00:15:00,680 --> 00:15:02,350
