270
00:15:12,040 --> 00:15:15,240
Collection Pavilion
Thunder Celestial Realm

271
00:15:19,400 --> 00:15:21,880
Forbidden ground guardian
Yao Family cultivator
Corporeal Yang

272
00:15:22,880 --> 00:15:24,870
Those not of the four great families

273
00:15:25,120 --> 00:15:26,670
