An Origin Soul that devours thunder !?

282
00:16:54,320 --> 00:16:55,710
Do you intend to keep watching !?

283
00:16:55,720 --> 00:16:57,120
Forbidden ground guardian
Chen Family cultivator
Corporeal Yang

284
00:16:55,720 --> 00:16:57,120
Forbidden ground guardian
Lu Family cultivator
Corporeal Yang

285
00:16:55,720 --> 00:16:57,120
Forbidden ground guardian
Song Family cultivator
Corporeal Yang

286
00:16:57,360 --> 00:16:58,310
Let me pass,

287
00:16:58,960 --> 00:16:59,990
and we can avoid this fight.

